WEBVTT

00:16.090 --> 00:19.360
All the unfair stuff that adults keep doing?

00:19.540 --> 00:19.580
PRESENTED BY DOUTEI SUBS

00:23.710 --> 00:26.330
"You better keep your promises!"

00:26.330 --> 00:28.580
Look who's talking!

00:30.360 --> 00:32.450
Live by what you preach.

00:33.540 --> 00:36.440
All those misplaced sympathies,

00:36.440 --> 00:38.970
nuh-uh, no way, I don't want.

00:38.970 --> 00:41.620
"I'm only saying this for your own sake!"

00:41.620 --> 00:43.680
I can smell the lie from here.

00:43.680 --> 00:46.520
When I hear your true desires,

00:46.520 --> 00:49.090
I dunno what I'll do from there.

00:49.090 --> 00:50.280
Should we do it?

00:50.280 --> 00:54.410
That's for me to decide.

00:54.410 --> 00:58.670
"If I spoil her, she'll just take advantage of it."

00:58.670 --> 01:04.120
You are so thickheaded, you'll never understand.

01:04.450 --> 01:08.770
If you truly care for me, it will surely lead to

01:08.770 --> 01:13.390
me becoming a more honest, gentle girl.

01:13.890 --> 01:18.470
And I hope you find me totally adorable.

01:18.910 --> 01:21.370
That I'll be.

01:21.370 --> 01:23.960
That's true.

01:23.960 --> 01:25.990
Naturally.

01:33.010 --> 01:34.330
Stop...

01:34.330 --> 01:36.560
Just stop!

01:36.560 --> 01:38.130
"What're you doing!"

01:38.130 --> 01:39.320
"Hurry and hit the books!"

01:40.330 --> 01:43.410
"His parents have just died, yet he isn't crying."

01:43.410 --> 01:46.750
"You eat us out of house and home, and here you are playing?!"

01:46.750 --> 01:47.420
Shut up...

01:47.420 --> 01:49.080
"Being here..."

01:47.750 --> 01:49.080
<i>Shut up...</i>

01:49.080 --> 01:49.770
Shut up...

01:49.770 --> 01:51.750
"...must be hard for you."

01:50.630 --> 01:51.750
<i>Shut up!</i>

01:51.750 --> 01:56.340
<i>Shut up... shut up... shut up... SHUT UP!</i>

01:51.750 --> 01:54.590
"You aren't out working, so quit loafing!"

01:54.590 --> 01:56.340
"If you went to Tokyo..."

01:59.770 --> 02:04.240
"Reiji, listen to your father."

02:04.240 --> 02:06.600
Then, there isn't anyone...

02:08.220 --> 02:11.510
...who will listen to me.

02:13.910 --> 02:16.250
Hear what I'm saying.

02:19.390 --> 02:21.990
Hear my voice!

02:22.910 --> 02:24.550
Hear me!

02:26.620 --> 02:29.950
I'm standing right here!

02:39.790 --> 02:41.190
Another one?

02:45.340 --> 02:47.930
Those people are long gone.

02:47.930 --> 02:49.330
So why?

02:49.840 --> 02:51.710
Why those vivid dreams?

02:53.570 --> 02:55.050
Don't hate.

02:55.980 --> 02:58.710
If you hate, you'll only suffer needlessly.

03:00.250 --> 03:02.890
If you're unable to forgive, then forget.

03:03.570 --> 03:06.240
Aki-san... did you forgive?

03:08.660 --> 03:10.150
I forgot.

03:14.040 --> 03:15.350
Aki-san.

03:19.660 --> 03:21.720
Rin? When did you...

03:38.420 --> 03:40.990
You smell just like Aki-san.

03:44.980 --> 03:46.050
Aki-san...

03:56.880 --> 04:01.840
11th Period

03:56.880 --> 04:01.840
EVERYONE GET ALONG

04:10.550 --> 04:12.310
All right, Mimi-chan!

04:12.730 --> 04:14.560
Good job, Usa!

04:14.560 --> 04:15.630
Thank...

04:16.590 --> 04:17.570
Mimi-chan.

04:25.310 --> 04:26.590
Almost forgot.

04:29.030 --> 04:31.700
She won't be forgiving me anytime soon.

04:47.790 --> 04:48.970
Here it comes!

04:48.970 --> 04:51.230
Oh... crap!

04:54.350 --> 04:56.460
All right!

04:57.360 --> 04:58.510
Rin-chan, nice!

04:58.510 --> 05:00.050
That's our Rin-chan!

05:12.370 --> 05:13.290
Okay!

05:13.290 --> 05:16.370
Next we have Team 1B versus Team 2C.

05:16.370 --> 05:19.230
Team 1A versus Team 2B.

05:19.230 --> 05:21.380
Get yourselves ready, we'll
assemble in five minutes.

05:23.970 --> 05:27.890
When you want to befriend someone, you must first be kind to that person.

05:28.630 --> 05:31.030
Being kind...

05:31.030 --> 05:33.090
What should I do?

05:35.400 --> 05:37.050
I'm going to the bathroom.

05:38.550 --> 05:39.250
Hmm?

05:39.890 --> 05:42.150
I feel... kind of sorry for him.

05:43.150 --> 05:46.330
Mimi-chan, are you going to forgive him?

05:46.330 --> 05:50.240
But I was the one who said something mean.

05:50.240 --> 05:52.010
Huh?

05:52.010 --> 05:56.250
Aoki-sensei is not like Nakamura-sensei.

05:56.250 --> 05:59.640
He isn't anything like him.

05:59.640 --> 06:03.230
I don't really want to ignore him.

06:04.230 --> 06:05.510
Hmm...

06:05.510 --> 06:06.940
Okay!

06:06.940 --> 06:08.260
Kuro-chan?

06:11.550 --> 06:14.870
Oh, sorry. I was supposed to do that.

06:14.870 --> 06:15.930
I'll take over.

06:22.990 --> 06:23.890
Huh?

06:27.580 --> 06:28.650
I won't lose!

06:29.280 --> 06:30.050
Eh?

06:30.050 --> 06:31.410
Virgin!

06:36.440 --> 06:38.240
Ka... Kagami...

06:38.240 --> 06:39.570
K-Kuro-chan!

06:39.570 --> 06:42.840
I didn't want to ignore
him, but this is too much!

06:42.840 --> 06:45.880
A bit of swelling will be good for him.

06:45.880 --> 06:47.340
More meat on the bone.

06:48.230 --> 06:50.850
I also swelled up!

06:50.850 --> 06:51.590
Kokonoe-

06:52.610 --> 06:54.990
Look at my huge jugs!

06:54.990 --> 06:56.850
Go ahead and feel them!

06:58.060 --> 07:00.850
Kokonoe's... back to normal?

07:01.160 --> 07:05.230
Sorry, sorry! I totally forgot
you're into mosquito bites!

07:05.230 --> 07:07.270
Wh-Who told you that?!

07:07.270 --> 07:08.370
You're blushing!

07:08.370 --> 07:09.740
Ko-Kokonoe!

07:09.740 --> 07:11.180
Hold it right there!

07:11.180 --> 07:12.690
Sensei...

07:12.690 --> 07:14.240
Sensei!

07:14.240 --> 07:16.230
B Team won!

07:17.490 --> 07:20.440
All right! First place is all but ours!

07:18.120 --> 07:20.440
Sensei is happy now?

07:21.220 --> 07:22.850
That's because he's a masochist.

07:22.850 --> 07:25.200
Huh? What's a masochist?

07:25.200 --> 07:28.950
It's someone who <i>likes it</i> when people badmouth and kick them around.

07:30.940 --> 07:33.010
If you put it that way...

07:33.710 --> 07:37.260
Then it's no wonder why Sensei pays way
more attention to Rin-chan and Kuro-chan

07:37.260 --> 07:40.690
than to me who gets good grades
and stays out of trouble.

07:43.590 --> 07:46.070
Kuro-chan, did you tell
her something disturbing?

07:46.070 --> 07:48.010
No way! Don't be ridiculous!

07:48.010 --> 07:49.570
All right, all right!

07:55.660 --> 07:58.590
First, I must be kind.

08:01.720 --> 08:03.440
Let's go!

08:04.480 --> 08:06.590
If we win this one, we'll be champions!

08:06.590 --> 08:08.340
Yeah!

08:08.340 --> 08:10.310
Let's come at them hard!

08:10.550 --> 08:13.270
We'll come and come and
keep coming till we drop!

08:13.940 --> 08:15.260
Kagami...

08:15.670 --> 08:20.770
Here... we... go!

08:24.150 --> 08:27.520
For the third grade, the winner is Class Two, Team C.

08:27.520 --> 08:30.030
Hurray!

08:30.240 --> 08:33.110
Bummer, we almost had 'em.

08:31.790 --> 08:35.590
For the fourth grade, the winner is Class One, Team B.

08:33.110 --> 08:35.130
It sure was close.

08:36.530 --> 08:40.690
It was all because I got hit right at the start.

08:41.540 --> 08:43.820
You did your best.

08:43.820 --> 08:45.620
You also took out someone from the sideline.

08:48.510 --> 08:51.800
Sensei really is kind.

08:51.800 --> 08:54.690
Being semi-finalists is nothing to sneeze at.

08:56.480 --> 08:59.470
Sh... Shut up, please.

08:59.850 --> 09:00.720
Hmm?

09:00.720 --> 09:05.400
I can't do stuff right because you keep staring at me with those horndog eyes of yours!

09:05.400 --> 09:08.730
My br-breasts are swollen!

09:09.070 --> 09:09.980
Huh?!

09:10.410 --> 09:11.610
You're all dismissed!

09:17.430 --> 09:19.280
Was that good enough?

09:19.280 --> 09:21.870
I wonder if he enjoyed that.

09:24.750 --> 09:28.070
U-Usa... san?

09:36.600 --> 09:37.890
I won! I won!

09:37.890 --> 09:40.660
I won against Aoki-sensei!

09:40.660 --> 09:42.430
All that hard work paid off!

09:44.330 --> 09:45.480
Huh?

09:45.480 --> 09:48.730
Was that the right path to take?

09:48.730 --> 09:50.290
I'm leaving!

09:50.290 --> 09:51.650
Uh, right!

09:53.100 --> 09:56.250
So that means she's still mad at me?

09:56.990 --> 09:58.310
Aoki-sensei.

09:59.030 --> 10:00.330
Yes?

10:00.330 --> 10:04.750
Class One was supposed to pick up the balls in the gym, correct?

10:04.750 --> 10:06.040
Is it already completed?

10:06.730 --> 10:07.540
Huh?

10:08.950 --> 10:12.990
Those kids... and I told them to do it!

10:12.990 --> 10:16.840
My class has gym first thing tomorrow morning.

10:18.150 --> 10:20.890
Honestly, what a useless class.

10:20.890 --> 10:23.730
Don't talk bad about my kids!

10:23.730 --> 10:25.720
Oh, my mistake.

10:26.250 --> 10:27.640
What a useless <i>teacher.</i>

10:40.950 --> 10:42.320
LOADING

10:40.950 --> 10:42.320
MY PICTURES

10:40.950 --> 10:42.320
PICTURE

10:58.340 --> 10:59.170
Sensei?

10:59.170 --> 11:02.260
Kokonoe?! Where were you?

11:02.260 --> 11:05.490
If you don't hurry home,
Reiji-kun will be worried.

11:07.130 --> 11:09.940
Reiji's... busy right now.

11:12.560 --> 11:14.450
Speaking of which...

11:14.450 --> 11:17.940
Kokonoe is always staying behind after school.

11:18.250 --> 11:21.590
She... wasn't waiting for me.

11:24.760 --> 11:26.150
I see now.

11:26.660 --> 11:28.910
How come I didn't notice sooner?

11:33.910 --> 11:36.370
If you give me a kiss, I'll give you a hand.

11:36.370 --> 11:38.170
Don't be stupid, just help!

11:38.170 --> 11:39.920
All right, this one's on the house.

11:39.920 --> 11:43.970
Even before I came to this
school... long before that...

11:46.500 --> 11:47.490
Hmm?

11:47.490 --> 11:48.470
What's wrong?

11:48.470 --> 11:50.890
Uh, nah.

11:50.890 --> 11:51.910
Nothing at all.

11:54.290 --> 11:56.310
Hey, wait a second!

11:59.520 --> 12:02.910
Hey, excuse me! I'm still in here!

12:02.910 --> 12:04.280
Excuse me!

12:04.280 --> 12:08.080
Ugh, you were too slow, Sensei!

12:08.080 --> 12:11.370
What was I supposed to do?
Everything went all dark.

12:13.250 --> 12:14.990
Excuse me!

12:14.990 --> 12:17.180
I'll see if there's another way out!

12:17.180 --> 12:17.840
Oh...

12:18.350 --> 12:20.420
Be careful!

12:20.420 --> 12:22.430
Right, I can use my cell...

12:25.300 --> 12:28.100
My cell's back in the staff office!

12:29.690 --> 12:31.180
I'm home!

13:05.960 --> 13:08.250
Rin... where are you?

13:12.680 --> 13:12.730
DANGERWATCH FORPEDESTRIANS

13:14.270 --> 13:14.310
CHILDREN
DIAL
110 FOR
EMERGENCIES

13:22.010 --> 13:22.530
Reiji...

13:25.760 --> 13:28.670
Protect Rin for me.

13:50.190 --> 13:50.970
Hey, watch out!

14:10.310 --> 14:11.490
Don't worry.

14:11.490 --> 14:14.370
The last teacher to leave
does final inspections.

14:14.370 --> 14:15.270
Okay.

14:16.780 --> 14:19.180
You just <i>had</i> to be so lightly dressed.

14:19.180 --> 14:21.710
Nights are starting to get really chilly.

14:27.340 --> 14:29.290
H-Hey, Kokonoe!

14:29.290 --> 14:31.350
It's warmer this way.

14:31.650 --> 14:35.490
It's freezing. Do you want
me to catch a cold?

14:38.790 --> 14:42.630
Your heart is beating really loud.

14:45.290 --> 14:46.630
This way...

14:47.710 --> 14:50.860
the sound of your heart
goes together with mine.

14:51.830 --> 14:54.370
Again with that stuff...

14:57.830 --> 14:58.620
Don't leave me!

15:02.400 --> 15:03.950
Don't leave me.

15:07.270 --> 15:08.880
I'll be leaving now.

15:08.880 --> 15:10.350
Good job today.

15:13.390 --> 15:15.270
Doing some urgent business?

15:16.700 --> 15:17.990
Uh, yes.

15:19.710 --> 15:20.390
Hmm...

15:21.290 --> 15:24.150
Aoki-sensei's sure taking his time.

15:27.160 --> 15:29.050
Boy do I envy him.

15:29.050 --> 15:29.650
Hmm?

15:35.130 --> 15:36.390
Aww...

15:36.390 --> 15:42.170
I should have told him, "If I win, you'll treat me to something to make up for that other time!"

15:48.290 --> 15:49.290
Now wait!

15:49.290 --> 15:51.180
That's stupid, Kyouko!

15:51.180 --> 15:55.470
Inserting your personal interests into a wholesome children's tournament is no way for a teacher to...

15:55.470 --> 15:56.680
Houin-sensei!

15:57.670 --> 15:59.490
Thank goodness. Come with us.

15:59.490 --> 16:00.430
Huh?

16:01.190 --> 16:02.940
When I do these things...

16:02.940 --> 16:05.250
I'll make you hate me.

16:05.250 --> 16:09.070
And I'll make you run away. I know.

16:10.080 --> 16:10.940
But...

16:10.940 --> 16:13.250
I was testing you.

16:13.250 --> 16:15.940
I wanted to see if you still loved me.

16:16.740 --> 16:20.450
But I thought you hated me.

16:21.030 --> 16:23.750
So then, I tested you some more.

16:28.000 --> 16:29.960
Care for me.

16:31.510 --> 16:33.620
Chastise me.

16:33.620 --> 16:36.190
Stay with me by my side.

16:38.370 --> 16:39.570
Why...

16:40.250 --> 16:44.730
Why would Kokonoe ask
for so much from me.

16:44.730 --> 16:46.590
Is she lonely?

16:46.590 --> 16:48.690
Is she in a warped environment?

16:49.720 --> 16:53.750
I can come up with a few answers to that question if I think about it.

16:54.760 --> 16:55.630
But...

16:58.890 --> 17:00.250
I'm sure we don't need...

17:01.630 --> 17:03.250
to answer that question.

17:04.680 --> 17:06.000
I'll be here for you.

17:08.210 --> 17:09.630
I'll be here for you.

17:18.550 --> 17:20.260
She's... hitting the right spot?

17:24.090 --> 17:25.410
S-Sensei?

17:25.410 --> 17:27.770
Not good - if she moves another inch...

17:28.210 --> 17:30.790
Please, let's stay like this for a while!

17:30.790 --> 17:32.530
O... kay...

17:33.280 --> 17:34.450
Oh yeah.

17:34.450 --> 17:36.340
I can count prime numbers.

17:36.340 --> 17:38.280
2... 3... 5...

17:38.280 --> 17:43.290
7... 11... 13... 17... 19... 23...

17:47.990 --> 17:49.960
Oh, it's from Reiji!

17:49.960 --> 17:51.930
He's been filling up my voicemail!

17:51.930 --> 17:54.880
You had a cell... all this time?

17:55.290 --> 17:58.410
I guess you can't get any bars in here.

17:59.890 --> 18:00.290
Yes?

18:00.290 --> 18:01.890
Where are you?!

18:01.890 --> 18:03.650
Where are you now?

18:03.650 --> 18:05.530
Rin, answer me!

18:05.530 --> 18:07.210
Rin? Rin!

18:08.960 --> 18:10.070
Rin!

18:10.830 --> 18:11.770
Reiji!

18:12.210 --> 18:13.570
Aoki-sensei?

18:13.570 --> 18:15.780
Why are you in here at this hour?

18:15.780 --> 18:17.560
Uh, yeah...

18:17.560 --> 18:21.590
I was cleaning up in the back
when someone locked the door...

18:24.410 --> 18:24.940
Reiji!

18:34.590 --> 18:36.670
Wha... What's your...

18:37.330 --> 18:40.180
You were here...

18:40.600 --> 18:41.180
Eh?

18:41.560 --> 18:44.180
You were right here.

18:44.180 --> 18:46.990
You were here... all alone with Rin!

18:46.990 --> 18:48.570
Stop, Reiji!

18:48.570 --> 18:49.690
Kokonoe!

18:49.690 --> 18:50.570
Rin?

18:51.510 --> 18:52.190
Move!

18:52.190 --> 18:53.190
No!

18:53.620 --> 18:55.610
R... Rin.

18:55.610 --> 18:57.270
Reiji...

18:57.270 --> 18:59.750
Protect... Rin.

19:02.600 --> 19:04.990
Rin... you're...

19:07.160 --> 19:10.490
You're... shielding this man?

19:11.390 --> 19:12.630
You're protecting him?

19:14.930 --> 19:16.130
Let's go, Rin!

19:16.870 --> 19:17.650
Kokonoe!

19:17.650 --> 19:18.470
No!

19:18.790 --> 19:20.650
Apologize to Aoki-sensei!

19:20.650 --> 19:22.590
If not, I'll-

19:23.470 --> 19:25.010
Must protect her.

19:25.010 --> 19:26.600
I must...

19:26.600 --> 19:29.100
protect... Rin!

19:29.570 --> 19:30.790
Reiji...

19:33.880 --> 19:34.810
Now wait!

19:34.810 --> 19:37.350
Just listen to what Aoki-sensei has to say!

19:37.350 --> 19:39.060
I don't need to!

19:39.060 --> 19:41.870
Wait, she clearly doesn't want to go!

19:41.870 --> 19:44.620
If... you say

19:44.620 --> 19:46.370
one more word...

19:53.090 --> 19:54.590
Let's go, Rin.

20:04.640 --> 20:09.170
I know we screwed up on our end, but he didn't have to get so angry.

20:09.640 --> 20:12.890
I'm going to Kokonoe's house!

20:12.890 --> 20:13.850
I'm talking to him again-

20:13.850 --> 20:15.170
Stop this instant!

20:15.170 --> 20:16.390
She's right.

20:16.390 --> 20:19.360
If you go, you'll only aggravate him again.

20:19.360 --> 20:22.090
But, I can't leave Kokonoe alone with...

20:24.270 --> 20:26.200
Shirai-sensei!

20:26.750 --> 20:28.380
Please calm down.

20:28.380 --> 20:30.950
You haven't done anything wrong, have you?

20:31.630 --> 20:32.710
Of course.

20:32.710 --> 20:34.460
Then act accordingly.

20:34.770 --> 20:36.510
You <i>are</i> a teacher.

20:38.960 --> 20:42.000
Kokonoe Rin is not your only student.

20:42.000 --> 20:45.820
If you act confused, how will you deal with your other students?

20:49.370 --> 20:51.610
Yes... I apologize.

20:51.610 --> 20:55.100
I'll send my completed assignments via e-mail.

20:55.100 --> 20:56.910
Well then, good night.

20:58.380 --> 20:59.360
Reiji...

21:01.860 --> 21:04.790
Now then, we're in for a long vacation.

21:04.790 --> 21:08.690
Since we couldn't do it during summer
break, we'll be together for quite a while.

21:08.690 --> 21:10.610
Please, listen to me! I-

21:10.610 --> 21:12.580
Let's have dinner!

21:12.580 --> 21:13.620
Reiji!

21:13.620 --> 21:15.500
Let's see...

21:15.500 --> 21:19.510
Listen to me! Aoki-sensei
didn't do anything ba-

21:24.110 --> 21:27.760
So would you like stuffed cabbages or twice-cooked pork?

21:29.850 --> 21:32.520
St... Stuffed cabbages.

21:33.330 --> 21:34.410
Roger that.

21:47.860 --> 21:49.940
I was tied by the rules crying my eyes out.

21:49.940 --> 21:52.520
Was I fed up so much I hit "C" and flew?

21:52.520 --> 21:54.950
If you wanna taste, go ahead and try it on the fly

21:54.950 --> 21:56.570
Heart racing, I get a flower on my test, smile and go

22:02.950 --> 22:05.520
Geh! No way! I'm not waiting ten years to LOVE LOVE!

22:05.520 --> 22:08.070
I can't resist, I've been dreaming of it ALL NIGHT.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.980
I will do what you say, MAYBE.

22:09.980 --> 22:13.150
For you, right now we'll have our WEDDING.

22:13.150 --> 22:15.670
Just tender kisses? NO NO! Adult thinking.

22:15.670 --> 22:18.220
We're taking it further and forceful - GO! IN!

22:18.220 --> 22:20.070
A HEART BEAT that is so loud.

22:20.070 --> 22:22.960
That's just how I do things, baby.

22:23.290 --> 22:28.560
Convey your feelings for me

22:28.560 --> 22:33.160
not with words, but through warm kisses.

22:33.160 --> 22:37.320
Let's turn our entire world

22:37.320 --> 22:43.290
upside down, right now.

22:44.010 --> 22:46.150
A girl's punch will get through, don't you think?

22:46.150 --> 22:48.760
Will the surprise be enough to attract you?

22:48.760 --> 22:51.220
A thought-over impulse is also great

22:51.220 --> 22:53.800
